      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "measured / estimated / unknown / restock_only are distinct states.\nAn explicit 0 is valid stock; a blank or restock-only answer has NULL quantity.",
      "originalText": "measured / estimated / unknown / restock_only are distinct states.\nAn explicit 0 is valid stock; a blank or restock-only answer has NULL quantity.",
